 ,  
 12 

 ]  To accomplish the aforementioned, there are several ways. Generally speaking, there are two categories of pure nanomaterials: p‐type and n‐type nanomaterials. Many nanomaterials have so far been effectively utilized as materials for sensing to identify oxidizing and reducing gases by converting information into signals (electrical) when exposed to the appropriate test gas. [ 

 13 
